cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Ring-Reconnection Plasma Research"
message: "If you use this software or its associated data, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Worth"
    given-names: "James B."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-5000-9497"
    email: "brenworth@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Valencia, Spain"
abstract: >-
  Hybrid particle-in-cell (PIC) simulations of laser-driven plasma physics
  with focus on ring-geometry magnetic reconnection. Includes the simulation
  pipeline, analysis tools, and orchestration infrastructure for an
  independent multi-paper research programme studying ion acceleration
  through reconnection electric fields in laser-target geometries with
  potential application to fusion physics and aneutronic fuels.
keywords:
  - plasma physics
  - particle-in-cell simulation
  - magnetic reconnection
  - hybrid-PIC
  - WarpX
  - laser-plasma interaction
  - aneutronic fusion
  - p-11B
  - non-thermal acceleration
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/laser-plasma-research"
date-released: 2026-06-03
version: 1.2.2
